    {
      "text": "Do you spend a lot of time choosing clothes?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.34
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I don't, because I hate doing it. Even if I spent ages choosing clothes, I couldn't guarantee I'd pick the best one — after the choice is made, I'd still regret it, thinking maybe there was something better. So I just don't spend much time on it. I look over the options, pick the best one at the moment based on my feeling, and that's it.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 2.72,
      "end": 19.44
    }
